@startuml sequence_live_activity
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Weekly Focus - Activity recorded mid-week

actor User
participant "Activity Page" as AP
participant "API" as API
participant "EventBus" as EB
participant "Notifier" as N
participant "SignalR" as SR
participant "Invalidations$" as IS
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C

User -> AP: Record activity (Move)
AP -> API: POST /activity
API -> EB: ActivityRecordedEvent
EB -> N: subscriber
N -> SR: dashboardTileDataInvalidated [weeklyFocus]
SR -> IS: emit
IS -> T: bindTileMode wakes
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /weekly-focus
API --> C: top-3 with updated counts
C --> T: focusAreas signal update
T --> User: List re-renders, pill stays LIVE

@enduml
